			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4854319">
									

<blockquote>
<p>When ingested, SCP-5110 adverse anomalous effects on the digestive system of the consumer. While the effects of SCP-5110 products typically vary with the specific item, with some being much less harmful, no item has been shown to have no anomalous effects on the consumer. Items of a specific SCP-5110 product designated further as SCP-5110-A through SCP-5110-D</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The first and last sentences of this paragraph are incomplete and grammatically incorrect, respectively. I'd be happy to give this article an editorial touch-up, since the author has moved on, but I will abstain for now and leave that decision to the individual who contacted the author and obtained permission to revise the article.</p>

