																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-50742/per-page-discussions">Per Page Discussions / Per page discussions</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/scp-5266/comments/show">SCP-5266</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4854311">
									

<p>I've been knee deep in depressing SCP's, ones that fill me with existential dread and stick with me all day. So, at first I wasn't going to upvote this. But I came back, read again and I am glad I did. It helped as a nice cleanser from some of the heavy articles I've been revisiting and I think my knee-jerk neutral response was my brain not being ready for this.</p>
<p>It is one of the few SCiPs I would dare classify as <em>cute</em>. I mean, other than all the toxic death.</p>

